  "scope": "Actual bridge and bounded scalar pixel copy compiled against Darwin22, with the exact original iPhone completion alias. The default mode copies completed producer pixels on the CPU and never offers to a presenter. GPU presenter handoff is explicit and still requires the caller to ensure failed/abandoned GPU work is quiescent before callback. Sanitized tests execute actual bridge/copy code with software IOKit, presenter and completion peers. No original queue hook, original retirement, producer fence, GPU failure quiescence, hardware latch or vblank is qualified."
